{"title":"Gaunt Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 33 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 29 times (2.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>883</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>503</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>651</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>530</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>529</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=0\" title=\"Pick level 0\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>883</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>503</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>651</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>530</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>529</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" d